OL,3,GNEWSAPensioner had 'largest hoard' of
OL,4,Achild abuse images to be seized in
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FA pensioner amassed what is thought to
OL,8,Fbe the largest collection of child
OL,9,Fsexual abuse material ever seized by
OL,10,Fpolice in Scotland, a court has heard.
OL,12,FAlan MacPherson, 83, from
OL,13,FStenhousemuir, was found to have over
OL,14,Ftwo million images on various
OL,15,Felectronic devices after his home was
OL,16,Fraided in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
