OL,3,GNEWSAPensioner had 'largest hoard' of
OL,4,Achild abuse images to be seized in
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 805,000 were formally
OL,8,Fidentified as depicting child sexual
OL,9,Fabuse  - much of it of the most serious
OL,10,Fcategory - while the overwhelming scale
OL,11,Fof his collection meant much of
OL,12,Fmaterial was not examined.
OL,14,FMacPherson, who admitted downloading
OL,15,Fthe material over a 14-year period, was
OL,16,Fplaced on the sex offenders register
OL,17,Fand remanded in custody at Falkirk
OL,18,FSheriff Court pending pre-sentence
OL,19,Freports.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
